{"format_version":"0.1","record_type":"person_source_bundle","requested_person_id":"cbr-p003448","identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","person_ids":["cbr-p003448"],"persons":[{"id":"cbr-p003448","label":"黥布（陳丞相世家候選）","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"黥布","mention_ids":["c-shiji-056-chen:m014-0013"]},{"surface":"布","mention_ids":["c-shiji-056-chen:m015-0004"]}],"evidence":[{"mention_id":"c-shiji-056-chen:m014-0013","chapter_id":"c-shiji-056-chen","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-056-chen:p014","quote":"黥布"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-056-chen:m015-0004","chapter_id":"c-shiji-056-chen","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-056-chen:p015","quote":"布"}]}],"mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-056-chen:m014-0013","start":13,"end":15,"surface":"黥布","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003448","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-056-chen:p014","chapter_id":"c-shiji-056-chen"},{"id":"c-shiji-056-chen:m015-0004","start":4,"end":5,"surface":"布","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003448","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-056-chen:p015","chapter_id":"c-shiji-056-chen"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[{"id":"d-shiji056-031","person_id":"cbr-p003448","surfaces":["布","黥布"],"scope":"same_chapter","chapter_ids":["c-shiji-056-chen"],"status":"contextual_provisional","evidence":[{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-056-chen:p014","quote":"其後常以護軍中尉從攻陳豨及黥布。凡六出奇計，輒益邑，凡六益封。奇計或頗祕，世莫能聞也。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-056-chen:p015","quote":"高帝從破布軍還，病創，徐行至長安。燕王盧綰反，上使樊噲以相國將兵攻之。既行，人有短惡噲者。高帝怒曰：「噲見吾病，乃冀我死也。」用陳平謀而召絳侯周勃受詔牀下，曰：「陳平亟馳傳載勃代噲將，平至軍中即斬噲頭！」二人既受詔，馳傳未至軍，行計之曰：「樊噲，帝之故人也，功多，且又乃呂后弟呂嬃之夫，有親且貴，帝以忿怒故，欲斬之，則恐後悔。寧囚而致上，上自誅之。」未至軍，爲壇，以節召樊噲。噲受詔，即反接載檻車，傳詣長安，而令絳侯勃代將，將兵定燕反縣。"}],"rationale":"依本篇明示名字、局部主語、授官爵與家世暫接。平城與負郭不作短名，韓王信與淮陰侯韓信、審食其與酈食其分開。上依高帝與孝文帝敘事換主語，指控與古代比擬不當已驗史實；未名者不補全名，女孫父親不由婚議推定。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-056-chen:p014","text":"其後常以護軍中尉從攻陳豨及黥布。凡六出奇計，輒益邑，凡六益封。奇計或頗祕，世莫能聞也。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-056-chen:m014-0004","start":4,"end":8,"surface":"護軍中尉","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003418","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-056-chen:m014-0010","start":10,"end":12,"surface":"陳豨","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003447","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-056-chen:m014-0013","start":13,"end":15,"surface":"黥布","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003448","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-056-chen","book_id":"b-shiji-056","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-056-chen"},{"id":"c-shiji-056-chen:p015","text":"高帝從破布軍還，病創，徐行至長安。燕王盧綰反，上使樊噲以相國將兵攻之。既行，人有短惡噲者。高帝怒曰：「噲見吾病，乃冀我死也。」用陳平謀而召絳侯周勃受詔牀下，曰：「陳平亟馳傳載勃代噲將，平至軍中即斬噲頭！」二人既受詔，馳傳未至軍，行計之曰：「樊噲，帝之故人也，功多，且又乃呂后弟呂嬃之夫，有親且貴，帝以忿怒故，欲斬之，則恐後悔。寧囚而致上，上自誅之。」未至軍，爲壇，以節召樊噲。噲受詔，即反接載檻車，傳詣長安，而令絳侯勃代將，將兵定燕反縣。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-056-chen:m015-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"高帝","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003428","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-056-chen:m015-0004","start":4,"end":5,"surface":"布","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003448","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-056-chen:m015-0017","start":17,"end":21,"surface":"燕王盧綰","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003449","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-056-chen:m015-0023","start":23,"end":24,"surface":"上","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003428","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-056-chen:m015-0025","start":25,"end":27,"surface":"樊噲","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003450","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-056-chen:m015-0038","start":38,"end":39,"surface":"人","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"未名者、群體、泛稱官職、氏族或代詞待覆核，不補姓名或未見家屬。"},{"id":"c-shiji-056-chen:m015-0042","start":42,"end":43,"surfac